WEBVTT

00:27:01.250 --> 00:27:03.042
Wow, that is really good.

00:27:04.208 --> 00:27:05.875
Alright, who else wants to try it?

00:27:07.417 --> 00:27:10.643
Yeah, that Cinnataco
didn't even make it home to Allison

00:27:10.667 --> 00:27:12.083
because it was delicious.

00:27:14.500 --> 00:27:18.309
Giving away some free Cinnabons
didn't really cost Anthony anything,

00:27:18.333 --> 00:27:21.684
and his team seemed to enjoy
the challenge of making the Cinnataco.

00:27:21.708 --> 00:27:24.917
One of them even suggested
they should put it on their secret menu.

00:27:25.667 --> 00:27:27.726
So the preparation
and information exchange

00:27:27.750 --> 00:27:29.500
that I had to do wasn't that heavy.